# Notices, credits and licences

DS41 is a serving recipe for **DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017** on a DGX Station
GB300 with an RTX PRO 6000 sidecar. It is a lot of small pieces standing on a
lot of generous work. This file records what is ours, what came from where,
and what to keep when you redistribute it. It is meant to be readable; the
full licence texts are in the appendices.

